# the stock agmsvc.te hwservice (the sm8450-ish one) conflicts with
# the sm8550 hwservice_contexts in common, so instead of messing
# with that, we just let the AGMIPC service run under hal_audio_default.
#
# now, the two services under the same context need to be able to
# talk with one another:
allow hal_audio_default hal_audio_default:binder { call transfer };
